R004 vendors the P001 native prefill kernels and launchers from the supplied
SANTA-Triton source archive (Apache-2.0), plus its untimed algorithmic validator.
Exact source hashes and integration-only edits are recorded in
 docs/TRITON_PREFILL_PROVENANCE.json. R004 did not vendor a decode kernel or third-party binary. Triton itself remains an external MIT-licensed dependency.

R006 adds a v16-inspired grouped decoder based on the supplied SANTA-Triton
Apache-2.0 source: native leaders, Philox identity, compact-span/online-softmax
contracts and packed-cache refresh. New route, flexible batched top-K integration,
prefix binary search and diagnostics replace K31-only machinery. Donor hashes
and approved integration edits are recorded in docs/GROUPED_DECODE_PROVENANCE.json.
No third-party compiled binaries or GPU benchmark results are shipped.
